The potential vulnerability is Insecure Deserialization, specifically Remote Code Execution (RCE) via YAML deserialization. This vulnerability arises because the code uses `yaml.Loader` (which defaults to `yaml.FullLoader` if not explicitly specified as `yaml.SafeLoader`) to parse YAML content from a file. If an attacker can control the content of the `yaml_file_path`, they can craft a malicious YAML file that, when deserialized, can instantiate arbitrary Python objects and execute arbitrary code on the server. This allows for potential system compromise by an attacker who can supply a specially crafted YAML input.

